Good morning Hamad,
Apologies for the delay in responding.
Dublin Bus have come back to me and confirmed that the following stops will=
 be served by routes E1, E2 and 39A throughout the day of the Marathon:

  *   Donnybrook Garda Station (774)
  *   Victoria Avenue (758)
  *   Donnybrook Stadium (759)

In relation to your query regarding the recommended passageway for electors=
 arriving at Sandymount Train Station, this may be a question for the Dubli=
n Marathon Group, if the Garda could not answer this for you. However, I wi=
ll follow up on this for you and come back with any information I receive.
Please let me know if there is anything else you need in the meantime.
Kind Regards,

Siobh=E1n Tivnan

